POST /recipes — manually create a recipe
GET /recipes — get user's recipes
GET /recipes/{id} — get one recipe
PUT /recipes/{id} — edit a recipe
DELETE /recipes/{id} — delete a recipe


POST /recipes/extract — send an image to the Python AI service and return the extracted recipe for review
POST /recipes — save the confirmed/edited recipe


